{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14268","headline":"早入朝书事 · 窦牟","name":"早入朝书事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"紫陌纷如画，彤庭郁未晨。\n列星沈骑火，残月暗车尘。\n隐轸排霄翰，差池跨海鳞。\n玉声繁似乐，香泽散成春。\n叹息驱羸马，分明识故人。\n一生三不遇，今作老郎身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"窦牟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14268.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14268","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}